      "side": 1,
      "message": "Only fires in the same-day-post-deadline case. When days_ahead is 0 (today is the deadline day) and now is past the deadline hour, the window path sets end to today\u0027s deadline hour, which is already behind start. Falling back to start + ssm_default_lifetime is the documented \u0027next window not within lifetime\u0027 case and keeps the schedule from ending before it starts. A 400 here would reject a request that worked pre-fix, so the fallback is the smaller change.",
      "parentUuid": "b4a4eb56_d50acb9a",
      "revId": "5f047397d82f97910e90f59b2774950f6b158856",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
